      "side": 1,
      "message": "My point isn\u0027t that `pkvm_reset_vcpu()` races with itself but rather that you need the same vCPU race with itself. The rollback code in `handle_pvm_entry_psci()` and the `power_state` change in `pkvm_reset_vcpu()` can only happen on the same vCPU thread.\n\n`pkvm_vcpu_init_psci()` is where pvmfw vs non-pvmfw guests are treated differently -- secondary CPUs in the RUNNABLE state are put into the `ON_PENDING` state if there is no pvmfw afaict.",
